    "description": "<p>Effect: The user takes -15 less Physical Damage and -5 less Special Damage while equipped, and has their RES increased by 5%.<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-species.r1xs6gQqlJMm5onZ]{Charcadet} users increase their Base DEF by +20, Base SPDEF by +10, and Base SPD by +10, and increase the Power of their Physical-Category Attacks by 30%.<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-species.LCbaDlO5nqqFyhAZ]{Ceruledge} users deal +15% more damage with @Trait[sharp] Attacks, and inflict @Tick[-1] with Critical Hits with their Physical-Category Attacks. <br><br>A Charcadet may consume this item in order to trigger Evolution.</p>",
